{"detail": {"templateUuid": "f451d51842454a6697c0a0434c10a156", "projectUuid": "618c561790f44c488c434828bca44dd7", "name": "赛博斩妖录", "description": "三百年前，一颗名为“渊”的陨石经过太阳系时，向地球撒下了数以亿计的微生物级寄生种子“渊种”，渊种是第三方（如天外陨石一类的）落下，使得人类和动物变异，人类不坚定者会兽化变成妖族，而受到渊种影响的兽族会反古变成山海经中的凶兽，成为大妖。这是人类的生存危机，也是人族和妖族必然开战的原因。\n世界分了很多人类居住区，新昆仑只是其中之一，外面有一座由人类狩渊司建立阻挡妖族的屏障，也是狩渊司抵御妖族入侵的第一线。背负叛徒之子的天才少年，与体内妖气共生的疯批少女灵魂绑定，在赛博修真都市中一边追凶复仇一边拯救世界，以非遗为刃、以人心为阵，终结一场深渊阴谋，旷世浩劫。", "coverUrl": "/assets/1cf578d29284b136.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/64872f4db7b34ec58e48fb61d3d14ebb/177d5db556bfb37d8ba3557715a5d9d80d58dc55.mp4", "snapshotId": 21284, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 145832, "ownerUuid": "64872f4db7b34ec58e48fb61d3d14ebb", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83erTf2Lbo2ztb4C1L5ZMZvEwNsFictmo7FrcQMgU3pfkVda2gGHEO0UXuMOTobExUn1OLRNejuSOaUQ/132", "nickname": "叶宏泽", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 251, "tags": [{"id": 3036, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "AI漫剧精卫计划", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3036/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3037, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "1-原创 IP 漫剧赛道", "parentTag": 3036, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3036/3037", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1802, "code": "3d", "tagLabel": "3D", "parentTag": 1800, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1800/1802/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HH7K6PEXU/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click&vd_source=7ac522b3a5ed01cec280312d44e11f35", "createAt": "2026年06月23日 12:01", "updateAt": "2026年06月24日 22:16", "publishAt": "2026年06月23日 12:01", "playCount": 338, "viewCreationProcessCount": 183, "copyCanvasCount": 38